\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{An edge seen from its other endpoint}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{On the periodic grid, the step from #{x} to #{x+e_j}
becomes a step from #{-x} to #{-x-e_j} when each coordinate
changes sign. A [connection](fdip-006D) stores its positive
link from an edge's tail to its head. Which positive link
gives the transport on this reversed step?
In \ref{fdip-0182} reversing the time step also changed the
sign of its centered difference.}
